---
import title from "../assets/title/type=title1.svg";
---

<section class="flex min-h-0 flex-1 bg-[#f3f2e8] pr-0 pl-6 md:pl-[72px]">
  <div class="relative min-h-0 flex-1 overflow-hidden bg-[#1a1a18]">
    <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-[#242432]" aria-hidden="true"></div>
    <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-black/45" aria-hidden="true"></div>

    <div class="absolute right-6 bottom-[72px] w-[min(440px,calc(100%-48px))] text-right md:right-[72px] md:bottom-[78px]">
      <img
        class="ml-auto w-full"
        src={title.src}
        alt="青森県立美術館"
      />
      <p class="mt-4 text-[15px] tracking-wide text-white/90">AOMORI KENRITU BIJYUTUKAN</p>
      <div class="mt-7 h-px bg-white/70"></div>
      <p class="mt-6 text-[15px] leading-7 font-bold text-white">
        青森の自然とアートの融合、魅力的な展示を中心に常設展示も楽しめる、<br class="hidden md:block" />
        おすすめスポット。一回は行ってみたい
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="absolute bottom-[78px] left-6 flex items-center gap-4 text-xl font-bold text-white md:left-[72px]">
      <span>01</span>
      <span class="h-px w-10 bg-white"></span>
      <span>03</span>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
